<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Gables Residential started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Gables Residential started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber initiated coverage of Gables Residential Trust with an attractive rating, a source at the brokerage said.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not available.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 1/8 at 24-1/4.</p>
</text>
